    process:timestamp "2026-03-09T10:55:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    process:utteranceText "I read that the angle of the blades matters a lot. They call it 'pitch angle' — if it's too steep, the wind just pushes the blade down instead of spinning it."^^xsd:string .

<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Hanlin-Dong/istem-pbl-ontology/main/ontologies/module-process.ttl#https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Hanlin-Dong/istem-pbl-ontology/main/vignette/vignette-wind-turbine.ttl#DA_07> a owl:NamedIndividual,
