    process:timestamp "2026-03-10T11:15:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    process:utteranceText "Balsa wood costs $15 per sheet and we need 4 sheets — that's $60 already. If we use cardboard for the tower base instead of plywood, we can stay under our $100 budget and still have enough for the motor."^^xsd:string .

