    process:timestamp "2026-03-10T10:15:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    process:utteranceText "What if we make the blades out of balsa wood instead of cardboard? It's lighter, so the wind can spin it faster. And we could carve an airfoil shape like a real wing."^^xsd:string .

